   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GBV Prevention Integration into Health Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity seeks to improve and sustain the integration of GBV prevention and response with HIV; Maternal, Newborn, and Child Health (MNCH); and Family Planning (FP) services and to strengthen health systems with community and facility linkages to care.</narrative>
